  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.8.0 - First release of Kuwantima.DataGrid, a companion package styling Avalonia's DataGrid control (Avalonia.Controls.DataGrid) to match the rest of Kuwantima.\n\nShips separately from the core Kuwantima package because DataGrid lives in its own Avalonia package, not core Avalonia — folding it into Kuwantima would force that dependency on every consumer, even ones who never use a grid. Install this alongside Kuwantima and add one more StyleInclude.\n\nCovers: column headers (hover/pressed, sort-direction glyph in accent orange), rows (hover, selection joining the same accent family as ListBox/ComboBox — solid accent fill, white text, orange left edge), alternating-row tint, grid lines, disabled state, and :invalid reusing KuwantimaValidationErrorBrush. Out of scope for this release: row grouping, frozen columns, inline cell-editing chrome, row-details expansion.\n\nNearly every color is a reuse of an existing Kuwantima brush (KuwantimaControlHoverBrush, KuwantimaGlassBackground, KuwantimaSplitterBrush, KuwantimaAccentOrangeBrush, KuwantimaValidationErrorBrush, the SystemAccentColor* ramp) rather than a new hue — consistent with Kuwantima's Color Philosophy of not introducing colors without intention.",
